vpinos-core (1.1.11) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Removed Setup > Audio Setup from the menu. The sound output is set in
    VPinOS Configuration's Sound Output section, and System Info lists
    every sound device. Network Settings, VPXConfig and VPinFE Map
    Controls are back to their old numbers in Setup.

